@host = https://localhost:7080
@googleCredential = paste-a-fresh-google-identity-services-credential

### Issue a CSRF token. The HTTP client keeps the paired cookie.
# @name csrf
GET {{host}}/api/auth/csrf

###
@csrfToken = {{csrf.response.body.$.requestToken}}

### Exchange a fresh Google ID credential for the secure local session.
POST {{host}}/api/auth/google
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credential": "{{googleCredential}}"
}

### The local user and current onboarding state.
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me

### Authoritative resumable onboarding details.
GET {{host}}/api/onboarding

### Redeem a single-use license.
POST {{host}}/api/licenses/redeem
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SRK-XXXXX-XXXXX"
}

### SuperAdmin: create a code. The plaintext response is shown only once.
POST {{host}}/api/admin/licenses
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expiresAtUtc": "2026-08-31T20:59:59Z",
  "notes": "2026 incoming cohort"
}

### SuperAdmin: revoke without deleting the user's calendar or events.
POST {{host}}/api/admin/licenses/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/revoke
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Administrative revocation."
}

### SuperAdmin: activate an existing user without generating a code.
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/activate
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Activation confirmed manually through the administration panel."
}

### SuperAdmin: inspect and change the global operational freeze.
GET {{host}}/api/operations/freeze

###
POST {{host}}/api/operations/freeze
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isFrozen": true,
  "reason": "Unexpected source structure is under investigation."
}

### The revisions validation is holding for review.
GET {{host}}/api/revisions?state=ReviewRequired&limit=50

### One revision with the findings that explain its state.
GET {{host}}/api/revisions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Approve a quarantined revision and publish it.
### The actor comes from the verified SuperAdmin session.
POST {{host}}/api/revisions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/approve
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approvalReason": "Checked the source: the drop is the exam period, not a parse fault."
}

### The diffs the dispatch gate is holding.
GET {{host}}/api/diffs?state=Held&limit=50

### One diff with the changes behind its hold, deletions first.
GET {{host}}/api/diffs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000?entryLimit=100

### Release a held diff for dispatch.
### Refused with 409 when the hold is ambiguity: that is fixed at the source.
POST {{host}}/api/diffs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/release
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "releaseReason": "Checked the source: the 38 deleted lessons are the ended anatomy block."
}

### End the local session.
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### The OpenAPI document, for importing into Postman.
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
